;; jak1-era. Spliced at rung 5: the generator's name parsing skipped the + in the
;; name, but the decompiler emitted the full section (ir2.asm L44); the earlier fear
;; of an unbound-symbol dispatch did not survive the sweep, since nothing in the jakx
;; decomp reads this symbol. Landed for symbol completeness like its wrapper siblings.
(def-mips2c generic-no-light+envmap function)

